  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>&#947;</mi><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>&#947;</mi><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>&#947;</mi><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Now using expansion of given function in terms of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>&#947;</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo></mrow></mfenced></mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfrac></math></p><p>Now for limit to exist constant terms should be zero</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Also coefficient&nbsp;of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;should be zero</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Also coefficient&nbsp; of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;should be zero</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>&#946;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>So limit becomes,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mi>&#945;</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>&#946;</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>&#947;</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mi>&#945;</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>&#946;</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>&#947;</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Now putting the value of limit we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>&#946;</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>&#947;</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>4</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Now on solving equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>4</mn></math>&nbsp;we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>Now putting these in all option we get,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><msup><mi>&#946;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><msup><mi>&#947;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>&#947;</mi><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p></blockquote>",
